hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"169","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Use bakhsh de, us par raham kar, use aafiyat de, use maaf kar; us ki mehmaani izzat wali kar, dakhila kushada kar; use pani, barf aur olon se dho de; safed kapde ke mail se pak karne ki tarah use khataon se pak kar; use us ke ghar se behtar ghar, ahal se behtar ahal, biwi se behtar biwi de; use jannat mein dakhil kar; qabr aur aag ke azab se use bacha. [Janaze ki dua]"
"170","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Hamare zinda-murda, hazir-ghaib, chhote-bade, mard-aurat ko bakhsh de. Ae Allah! Hum mein se jise zinda rakhe Islam par zinda rakh, jise maut de iman par maut de. Ae Allah! Hamein us ke ajr se mahroom na kar, us ke baad hamein gumrah na kar. [Janaze ki dua]"
"171","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Falan bin falan tere zimme aur teri panah ke ahad mein hai; use qabr ke fitne aur aag ke azab se bacha; Tu hi wafa aur haqq wala hai; use bakhsh de, us par raham kar; beshak Tu hi bahut bakhshne wala, nihayat raham wala hai. [Janaze ki dua]"
"172","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Tera banda aur teri bandi ka beta teri rahmat ka mohtaj hua; Tu us ke azab ka mohtaj nahin; nek hua to us ki nekiyan badha de, bura hua to use maaf kar de. [Janaze ki dua]"
